    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d166">

                <pb facs="0347" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 166.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Scruggs to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 17,
                        1885</date>. (Received October 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 234.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The capture of the rebel flotilla and the
                    opening of the Magdalena River to navigation, as reported in my No. 230, of the
                    29th August last, is now confirmed by official reports. The report of the
                    capture of Ricardo Gaitan, the “general” in command of the rebel forces on the
                    river, was, however, premature. It was another Gaitan who was captured. Ricardo
                    made his escape, and is now supposed to be somewhere in the State of
                    Antioquia.</p>
                <pb facs="0348" n="220" xml:id="pg220"/>
                <p>With the exception of a few small bands of guerrillas in the remote districts
                    (which are rapidly disappearing) the civil war is considered over for the
                    present. I say “for the present,” because there seems to be a very general
                    impression here that we are to have another “revolution” soon. * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>WILLIAM L. SCRUGGS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
